{"id":"e672124c87f9c3e9","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kt-real-addition.md","title":"K平凡实数在单位区间内的加法闭合","display":"thm-kt-real-addition — K平凡实数在单位区间内的加法闭合","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kt-real-addition","aliases":["43-thm-kt-real-addition"],"display":"thm-kt-real-addition — K平凡实数在单位区间内的加法闭合","depends_on":["[[43-df-ktrivial-real]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Theorem 15.1.46; printed pp.431–432 / PDF pp.451–452","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kt-real-addition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kt-real-addition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kt-real-addition — K平凡实数在单位区间内的加法闭合"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cea02ee793bb0f7b\" href=\"?note=cea02ee793bb0f7b\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial-real\">43-df-ktrivial-real</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 15.1.46; printed pp.431–432 / PDF pp.451–452"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in[0,1]\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha+\\beta\\le1\">\\(\\alpha+\\beta\\le1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}\">\\(\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cea02ee793bb0f7b\" href=\"?note=cea02ee793bb0f7b\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial-real\">43-df-ktrivial-real</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\beta)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\alpha+\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\beta)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\alpha+\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本库的KTrivialReal接口仅定义在[0,1]，所以把原书任意K平凡实数加法陈述限制到和仍在该区间的情形。证明用固定宽度的初段候选及一个进位位；二进有理和单独可计算，不能依靠未定义的无限进位约定。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 15.1.46; printed pp.431–432 / PDF pp.451–452。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ktrivial-real","status":"resolved","id":"cea02ee793bb0f7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial-real]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ktrivial-real","status":"resolved","id":"cea02ee793bb0f7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in[0,1]$ 且 $\\alpha+\\beta\\le1$；$\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}$ 见 [[43-df-ktrivial-real]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha+\\beta\\le1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\beta)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\alpha+\\beta).","display":true}],"bytes":1488,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-413","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kt-real-addition]] — K平凡实数在单位区间内的加法闭合"}],"outgoing":["cea02ee793bb0f7b"]}